# Review model aligned with hoh-minimalism-product-page.
# Feature changes need one independent approving review from a developer with
# write access. No catch-all rule: developers can review each other.
# Governance changes require a member of the technical-admins team.
# Grant this team explicit write or Admin access in every generated repository.
# Team access and branch rulesets are not copied with template files.

/.github/      @House-of-Helix-CMD/technical-admins
/.helix/       @House-of-Helix-CMD/technical-admins
/releases/     @House-of-Helix-CMD/technical-admins
/CODEOWNERS    @House-of-Helix-CMD/technical-admins
/docs/schemas/ @House-of-Helix-CMD/technical-admins
